->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Reformer Pilates</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exercises on a reformer machine with springs. Small groups, for people who already know the basics.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost/lume/website/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/reformer_pilates.jpg\" alt=\"Reformer Pilates\" class=\"wp-image-8 size-full\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"wide\",\"mediaId\":9,\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost/lume/website/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/barre.jpg\" alt=\"Barre\" class=\"wp-image-9 size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Barre</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Small movements at a ballet bar. Good for legs and balance. No dance experience needed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"40px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:media-text {\"align\":\"wide\",\"mediaPosition\":\"right\",\"mediaId\":10,\"mediaType\":\"image\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide has-media-on-the-right is-stacked-on-mobile\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prenatal Pilates</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Gentle and safe exercise during pregnancy, with a focus on breathing and comfort.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"http://localhost/lume/website/wp-content/upl